{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotdog Butcher</strong> is a single-player horror experience where you live the routine life of a hotdog vendor by day and face a dark past by night. The story begins in a lively carnival\u2026 then drags you through your home, the streets, and into deeper, forgotten places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Prepare orders, mix sauces, and serve your customers. Under the bright, colorful lights everything feels alive\u2026 yet something is off and that feeling grows stronger with each passing day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/e8aead7d09d9508e7e79d6468296f829.poster.avif?t=1761569228\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/e8aead7d09d9508e7e79d6468296f829.webm?t=1761569228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/e8aead7d09d9508e7e79d6468296f829.mp4?t=1761569228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to people; every answer can change the course of the story. Some characters may act friendly, others hide something from you. The truth is a secret everyone knows but no one dares to speak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/c8e68e3f8aa1e214d2535e08f40267a7.poster.avif?t=1761569228\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/c8e68e3f8aa1e214d2535e08f40267a7.webm?t=1761569228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/c8e68e3f8aa1e214d2535e08f40267a7.mp4?t=1761569228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights go out, the sounds begin to change. Explore the environments, examine objects but remember, sometimes what you see is meant only for you. Each chapter unveils more of the story\u2026 and introduces you to a new kind of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/d1616e93a6e6b39bb998c5791e150660.poster.avif?t=1761569228\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/d1616e93a6e6b39bb998c5791e150660.webm?t=1761569228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/d1616e93a6e6b39bb998c5791e150660.mp4?t=1761569228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotdog Butcher</strong> starts quietly but slowly builds into an intense, psychological horror experience. It all begins in a hotdog truck\u2026 and by the end, you may question who\u2019s truly innocent.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3109560?t=1761569228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/ec3f750bfb2ba125e5ae6cba8a2777e825ab4cd9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761569228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/080754851a7f50ad4fdf7ab6fb5def3e71f2e7a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761569228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/080754851a7f50ad4fdf7ab6fb5def3e71f2e7a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761569228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custo